## Test that llvm-bolt gracefully handles a PE/COFF binary with no .pdata
## section. It should report the missing section and still produce output.

# RUN: yaml2obj %p/Inputs/no-pdata.yaml -o %t.exe
# RUN: llvm-bolt %t.exe -o %t.out.exe 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

# CHECK: BOLT-INFO: processing PE/COFF binary
# CHECK: BOLT-WARNING: no .pdata section found
